build obj/libmems/_libmems_test_support-install_config.stamp: stamp
build obj/libmems/_libmems_test_support_pkg_config-install_config.stamp: stamp
build obj/libmems/all.stamp: stamp obj/libmems/install_headers.stamp ./lib/libmems.so obj/libmems/libmems_pkg_config.stamp ./lib/libmems_test_support.so obj/libmems/libmems_test_support_pkg_config.stamp ./libmems_testrunner
build obj/libmems/install_headers.stamp: stamp
build obj/libmems/install_test_pkg_config.stamp: stamp
subninja obj/libmems/libmems.ninja
